{"server":"cn","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_04_beg","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_04","title":"无人的小巷","storyCode":"DV-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b194940205b4f8755c68333994b5d0808ed594868e4632947ef0c60270e82095","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"酒吧里，霍尔海雅突然现身，阻止医生进一步吐露情报，博士等人追击，却再次遭遇动力甲的阻挠；城外，赫默发现埃琳娜偷偷记录实验数据，对这实验的目的产生了怀疑。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不认识你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_i01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我可要伤心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦给我来一杯“汐斯塔冰茶”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——给这位先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看来是酒吧里的冷气太足了，所以这位先生才哆嗦个不停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那为何不再多喝一杯暖暖身体？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，差点忘了，你口味变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以前还是主刀医生的时候，你最喜欢的还是“汐斯塔冰茶”，因为够烈，喝下去就能让你忘掉洛肯·威廉姆斯的挑刺和辱骂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在他的刑期还剩一百二十二年，而你......你自由了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自由......你跟我谈论自由？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我按你们说的，每周都会上传身体数据......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别提工作上的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家来酒吧，不都是为了放松一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你宁可与这两位......一个看不清表情一个没有表情的人聊天，也不愿意和你的老朋友喝一杯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老朋友？呵......你开什么玩笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我变成这样，不都是因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，敬自由。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅，他们让我别无选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只能靠自己了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人端起面前的酒杯，在众人目光下喝下大半。\n他用力瞪着双眼，什么人都没看，神情说不清是愤怒还是绝望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"很快，他就直挺挺地倒了下去。\n他的双腿像突然受到电击似的抖动着，左手却死死地抓着自己的右臂。\n他的指尖几乎要抠进自己的血肉里，仿佛想把那团折磨他的电子元件连同过去的罪恶一起扯出身体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧客人","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，这个人怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧客人","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快打急救电话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"急病？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"酒里有问题？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......癫痫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血液成分异常，是药物诱发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给他注射了急救药剂，他的命能保住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那杯酒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还剩下半杯啊......我不喜欢浪费东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喝掉了剩下的酒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想不通的话，你可以检查一下你朋友的牙齿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——左侧第二小臼齿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一颗中空的假牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在离开洛肯水箱之前，他做了最后一场手术，手术对象正是自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你早就知道这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本该亲手排除掉这个变量。毕竟，摘掉一颗牙齿并不会影响他的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我始终相信，在哥伦比亚，人们至少应该拥有拥抱死亡的自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你扶着这位病人，站远一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你是打算......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们眼前有一个问题不得不解决。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵实验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，新的测试数据出来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望这结果值得你在我面前大喊大叫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百分之六十七？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵实验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，我、我们已经尽力了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重复实验的结果呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵实验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也、也在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把所有参数都拿过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵实验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵实验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老山羊居然真的没有耍花招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下就看霍尔海雅的了......她最好给我拦住塞雷娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能被前莱茵防卫科主任称作不得不解决的问题，我很荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没见过我，塞雷娅主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我听过你的许多事迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱茵生命创始人之一，同样毕业于特里蒙理工大学，取得生物医学工程博士学位以后，却几乎在学界销声匿迹，转而负责防卫科——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提到莱茵生命，人人皆知克丽斯腾·莱特，却很少有人听说过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年来，你有过不甘心吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没这个必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我自己的选择，也是我的职责所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把自己当成救火员，但你最享受的其实是冲进火场的感觉，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喜欢战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不意味着你是个战士，塞雷娅。你没有不断挑战和破坏的欲望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这让你在科学界格格不入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年前，缪尔赛思送给过你一株嫁接植物。挺好看的，对吧？她用了一点她最擅长的小花招，让藤蔓学会了舞蹈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你收下了礼物，但在那之后，每天早上七点，你都会在办公室里将那些生长得过于恣意的嫩芽修剪掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直在监控莱茵生命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我只是听说了一点办公室八卦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你一定没听说，那个夏天，缪尔赛思让三位主任的办公室变成了萨尔贡雨林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这给防卫科造成了不小的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你来说，炎魔是多大的麻烦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说了这么多废话，至少有一点是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实不讨厌战斗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好漂亮的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年你对你们总辖动手的时候，是不是也用的这招？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为一个雇佣兵，你好奇的事情未免太多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧客人","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们怎么打、打起来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧客人","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是喝醉了闹事吗？怎么没有保安管管？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧客人","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是保安吗？你快点把她们赶走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我只是一名机械师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了性命考虑，该走的是各位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧客人","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪！天花板快塌了，快、快走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！你没事吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我没事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这位线人先生问题比较大。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Mechanist，去帮塞雷娅。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么急着结束战斗啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道不想让我多陪你一会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哥伦比亚，能扛下你一击的人不多吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以你的身手，没几个人付得起这笔佣金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此事与沃尔沃特科钦斯基关系不大，你的战斗方式也并不是军队训练出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你急于让银色试剂的线索中断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你的雇主是斐尔迪南，还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总辖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅，哪怕到了这个地步，你第一个怀疑的对象也依然不是她吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有太多问题。我必须把你留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"塞雷娅看清楚了自己同僚所在的位置。敌人的后路已被封锁。\n并不需要更多交流，她不假思索地施放了源石技艺。\n珐琅质的坚壁瞬间显现，手刀直指霍尔海雅的要害。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来谈话该结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不躲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没这个必要。我从来不做成功率太低的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"塞雷娅的五指本该触碰到对面之人的腹部。\n奇怪的是，那并非人类血肉的触感。\n霍尔海雅的脸上丝毫没有疼痛的痕迹。\n她甚至凑得更近，嘴唇几乎触碰到了塞雷娅的耳廓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅，不管你信不信，我真的只是想找你聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对你很好奇......我对莱茵生命很好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的到来伤害了我的同伴。这种行为通常不能被称作搭讪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......谁让我也有必须完成的工作呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后送你一句话吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要急着与我为敌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要急着与任何人为敌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她跳了出去？这墙上......怎么会有一个洞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我干的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的源石技艺误导了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是源石技艺，是某项技术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她改变了附近一定区域内的空气成分构成，干扰了我和我的源石技艺造物的联系，导致我的最后一击偏离了方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这项技术......我之前从未见过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"缪尔赛思......","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缪尔赛思的失踪很有可能与她有关。"}]},{"label":"她会不会也能切断施术者和水分子的联系？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想过，定向加热空气不是什么高端的技术，不至于能控制住缪尔赛思。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我建议我们立刻追击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论从她掌握的情报来看，还是从她使用的离奇技术来看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位黎博利女士都极端危险。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警长，您这是要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道我还需要跟你报备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记录显示，您取走了一辆载具的钥匙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，借用一下你们莱茵的资产。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你乐意的话，帮我跟那个什么混蛋主任报备下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......警长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么话要说？麻烦快一点，我赶时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛丽·班纳女士，您从小就在特里蒙北郊的铁驮镇上生活。桑尼·罗马诺是您的邻居兼中学时的同窗好友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你调查我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四年前，罗马诺被登记为感染者，结束了在律所的实习工作，返回铁驮镇。他的医疗保险费用在六个月后停缴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是直到又过去三个月零十七天后，他的名字才出现在了这支拓荒队的名单上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中间这段时间，他究竟躲在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"预防问题发生也是我们防卫科工作的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小子，别以为你背一段资料就能吓到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我花了五年时间才爬到这个位置上，你当我不知道怎么跟你们这帮大公司养的虫子打交道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——女士，我从来没有质疑过您的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就别逼我把你丢到荒地上喂牙兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......警长，也许您不相信我，可我只是想提醒您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您偶尔会让我想起我曾经的上司。我很尊敬她，但她被私人情感影响，亲手毁掉了自己的前途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不忍心看到您走上一样的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......私人情感？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算这玩意儿能救人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也救不了自寻死路的那一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紧急通讯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"联系斐尔迪南主任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......第十七次记录，坐标，九区走廊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对象位置距离上次记录没有发生变化......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......基础粒子结构稳定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是没信号，什么消息都发不出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（进度不能耽搁，得尽快修改方案......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等通讯一恢复，得让老板收到这些报告。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......埃琳娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这里干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我走两步喘口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白你对拓荒者心有芥蒂......但我们最好还是待在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次袭击发生在十分钟前，距离这里很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们再次出现的话，你一个人会很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，我这就回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在回去之前，你......你真的没有什么想对我说的话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂你在说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拓荒者们的情绪并不稳定。要是再次激怒他们，乔伊丝会有危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我理解你并不想在他们面前说出真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这里只有我和你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想问实验的事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是项目成员，除非你向公司提出申请......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再用这样的说辞搪塞我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你跟我隐瞒了很多事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不生气。我们是朋友，也是同事。莱茵生命的保密规定一向严格，规则之外，每个人也习惯于隐藏自己的真实想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利维亚，我不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。我怎么可能不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公司里的感染者并不多。那时候你刚来，午休的时候你主动跟我打招呼......能量科的同事拉住你，偷偷告诉你我是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是向我走了过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不在意你身上那些石头，谁还没点毛病？说你闲话的人，他们就都完美无缺了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算后来......我也不在意我自己身上的石头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，这才是我认识的埃琳娜·乌比卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很清楚，这里的实验出现了问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打从一开始，你就知道那些银色物体是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们在威胁我们......和外面所有无辜者的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识的埃琳娜，绝对不会坐视这么可怕的事情发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么让你选择闭口不言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是斐尔迪南......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奥利维亚，这是我的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就跟海伦，还有无数为莱茵生命工作的研究员一样......我的梦想就在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说过，你也曾经感激过帕尔维斯主任和莱茵生命。而我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"narration","text":"背出那张星象图。\n不要给我看你的物理测验成绩。满分？和零分一样，都没有意义。\n你是乌比卡家的女儿。学习这些无用的大地上的知识，只会辱没你的姓氏。\n星源，我对你太失望了。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"narration","text":"......这就是你努力了一个多月的成果？\n......\n我不否认你有天赋，但在哥伦比亚的科研界，天赋人人都有，是最没有价值的东西。\n你有决心，可未经考验的决心可能很脆弱。\n你很勤奋，可没有方向的勤奋等同于莽撞。\n这个时代正等着你来改变，你浪费的每一个机会，对你自己以及你身处的这个时代而言都是潜在的巨大损失。\n埃琳娜，我在成千上万的学生中挑选了你，这最好不是一个错误。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......斐尔迪南是我努力的目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他许诺了你什么？帮弗兰克斯主任做完这个实验，就让你单独带项目？还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利维亚，你和姐姐一样，还当我是眼巴巴等着糖果的小孩子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你对斐尔迪南......对主任有很多误解，你这几年做的那些针对他的调查已经给他添了不少麻烦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我用不着替他解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，他原本可以拒绝你和罗德岛介入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他也想改变莱茵生命，改变哥伦比亚......而且我相信只要有机会，他真的能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......这么相信斐尔迪南？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道莱茵......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在那里......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是那些东西又追上来了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是拓荒队的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来......原来领队说的都是对的，你、你们的确是把我们当成实验用兽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能理解错了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还想哄骗我们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不会再相信了！你们对我们好，都是假的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请冷静一些，嗯......你叫迈尔对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迈尔先生，你不信任我们的话，桑尼就在旁边，你让他来解释一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想......我不想死在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这该死的......该死的走廊！根本走不到尽头......就和感染者收治区的高墙一样让我喘不过气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放过我吧，让我们离开......求你了，我求你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你不答应，我、我就杀了她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鸮","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔伊丝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会......怎么会这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，放开乔伊丝......不要伤害她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从地面痕迹来看，她刚走过了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能分辨她离去的方向吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面那条巷子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续追。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"等一下。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"还有几个疑点没有厘清。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你有什么新发现？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"刚才那场战斗，我们赢了吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不计较任意一场战斗的输赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白博士的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个黎博利赢不了我们，但也不至于输得那么快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她至少还能再坚持个三分钟左右。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"又或者，她可以在Mechanist赶来之前撤走。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她像是故意等Mechanist和我赶到。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她像是故意留下什么信息。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她想引我们进这条巷子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们还要进去吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"进。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我们都准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们很快就会追上来吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以塞雷娅的性格，就算猜到了我想引她来这里，她也一定会来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是有点担心......那个，动力甲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不用经过斐尔迪南先生同意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，你想考虑一下我更早的提议？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说把我......不不，我什么都没说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一场测试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的雇主会乐于见到结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我听到脚步声了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知领航小队，开始行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
